WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.065 --> 00:00:06.227
"We have to get out of these cubes!" Roxy stamped her foot.

2
00:00:06.228 --> 00:00:10.713
Cozlin sighed. "Yeah, but how?"

3
00:00:10.714 --> 00:00:13.728
The Battle Master was still talking to the crowd.

4
00:00:13.729 --> 00:00:15.557
He gestured at the cubes.

5
00:00:15.558 --> 00:00:19.374
"The best fighters in the galaxy are in these cells.

6
00:00:19.375 --> 00:00:22.771
I brought them here to battle each other for you!"

7
00:00:22.772 --> 00:00:26.188
The audience cheered.

8
00:00:26.189 --> 00:00:29.925
"The rules are simple," the Battle Master said.

9
00:00:29.926 --> 00:00:36.007
"Each battle lasts until one fighter surrenders or gets knocked out."

10
00:00:36.008 --> 00:00:39.723
Roxy punched a wall. "Let us out!"

11
00:00:39.724 --> 00:00:41.632
The Battle Master didn't hear her.

12
00:00:41.633 --> 00:00:45.794
"The winner of the tournament will go free!"

13
00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:51.198
Cozlin looked at Roxy. "One of us needs to win and help the other to escape."

14
00:00:51.199 --> 00:00:52.581
Roxy nodded.

15
00:00:52.582 --> 00:01:00.974
"But that's not all!" The Battle Master paused while the audience cheered again.

16
00:01:00.975 --> 00:01:04.800
"The winner will also receive this!"

17
00:01:04.801 --> 00:01:07.771
A hologram appeared in the middle of the stadium.

18
00:01:07.772 --> 00:01:11.713
It showed an enormous, sparkling asteroid on a floating platform.

19
00:01:11.714 --> 00:01:16.224
Roxy saw the actual platform on the other side of the stadium.

20
00:01:16.225 --> 00:01:18.508
Cozlin's eyes went wide.

21
00:01:18.509 --> 00:01:24.283
"This asteroid is made of solid gold," the Battle Master said.

22
00:01:24.284 --> 00:01:29.277
"It's the most valuable asteroid in the galaxy!"

23
00:01:29.278 --> 00:01:32.630
Cozlin smiled. "Wow!"

24
00:01:32.631 --> 00:01:36.456
Roxy rolled her eyes. "Stay focused!

25
00:01:36.457 --> 00:01:40.449
We need to escape—not win a golden asteroid."

26
00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:44.682
Cozlin shrugged. "Maybe we can do both."

27
00:01:44.683 --> 00:01:53.714
The Battle Master held up his arms. "Let the Galactic Battle Bonanza begin!"

28
00:01:53.715 --> 00:01:56.687
One cube floated toward the middle of the stadium.

29
00:01:56.688 --> 00:01:59.275
The hologram showed the alien inside.

30
00:01:59.276 --> 00:02:01.878
The alien had sharp pincers.

31
00:02:01.879 --> 00:02:09.821
"Please welcome planet Zardon's worst villain," the Battle Master said. "Caladon!"

32
00:02:09.822 --> 00:02:14.999
A second cube floated out. This alien had a tail with a stinger.

33
00:02:15.000 --> 00:02:19.076
"Caladon is tough, folks," the Battle Master said.

34
00:02:19.077 --> 00:02:27.920
"But is he a match for Korax's deadly stinger? Let's find out!"

35
00:02:27.921 --> 00:02:31.899
The cubes disappeared, and the two aliens charged toward each other.

36
00:02:31.900 --> 00:02:36.364
Just before they collided, Korax spun around and whipped her tail.

37
00:02:36.365 --> 00:02:40.108
Caladon dodged it, and the sharp stinger stabbed the ground.

38
00:02:40.109 --> 00:02:44.539
Caladon leaped. One of his pincers snapped Korax's tail.

39
00:02:44.540 --> 00:02:47.315
"Ouch!" Korax cried.

40
00:02:47.316 --> 00:02:51.338
Roxy shook her head. "I don't like this at all."

41
00:02:51.339 --> 00:02:54.021
"Me neither," Cozlin said.

42
00:02:54.022 --> 00:02:58.267
Korax swung her tail wildly. Caladon moved fast.

43
00:02:58.268 --> 00:03:01.933
He darted toward Korax and jumped over the swinging tail.

44
00:03:01.934 --> 00:03:05.859
Snap! His pincers cracked Korax's armor.

45
00:03:05.860 --> 00:03:09.500
"Grr!" Korax stamped her foot.

46
00:03:09.501 --> 00:03:14.866
Caladon laughed. "Do you give up yet? Or should we keep on—?"

47
00:03:14.867 --> 00:03:18.332
Wham! Korax's tail hit Caladon hard.

48
00:03:18.333 --> 00:03:22.671
"Oof!" Caladon flew backward and slammed into a wall.

49
00:03:22.672 --> 00:03:27.092
Caladon held up his pincers. "I surrender!"

50
00:03:27.093 --> 00:03:30.986
Right away clear cubes reappeared around the two fighters.

51
00:03:30.987 --> 00:03:32.680
The crowd cheered.

52
00:03:32.681 --> 00:03:35.829
The Battle Master returned to the middle of the stadium.

53
00:03:35.830 --> 00:03:42.366
"Congratulations, Korax. And now for our next battle!"

54
00:03:42.367 --> 00:03:44.488
Two new cubes floated out.

55
00:03:44.489 --> 00:03:46.559
One cube was huge.

56
00:03:46.560 --> 00:03:50.701
A tall creature with an ax stood inside.

57
00:03:50.702 --> 00:03:53.635
It blocked Roxy's view of the other cube.

58
00:03:53.636 --> 00:03:58.999
"This fighter comes from Glomulon 9," the Battle Master said.

59
00:03:59.000 --> 00:04:02.149
"It's a planet where it rains lava.

60
00:04:02.150 --> 00:04:09.352
But he doesn't mind. Please give a cheer for Glytar!"

61
00:04:09.353 --> 00:04:13.183
The audience roared.

62
00:04:13.184 --> 00:04:17.753
"The next fighter doesn't look tough," the Battle Master said.

63
00:04:17.754 --> 00:04:23.207
"But he likes to brag that he once defeated Heaven's entire army.

64
00:04:23.208 --> 00:04:31.930
I'm pleased to present . . . Sun Wukong!"

